## 2. Understand the SOC Detection Workflow

```text
Linux Endpoint
      ↓
SSH Authentication Events
      ↓
Wazuh Agent
      ↓
Wazuh Server
      ↓
Detection Rules
      ↓
Wazuh Alert
      ↓
SOC Analyst
      ↓
Investigation and Triage
```

Wazuh can analyze collected events using its detection rules and display matching alerts in the dashboard.

