## 9. Build an Event Timeline

Create a simple timeline using the evidence you collected.

| Time | Event | Investigation note |
|---|---|---|
| 10:15:01 | Failed SSH | Identify account and source |
| 10:15:05 | Failed SSH | Check whether source is the same |
| 10:15:09 | Failed SSH | Assess frequency |
| 10:16:00 | Successful SSH | Verify account and source |

The times above are examples. Replace them with actual timestamps from your lab.

A timeline helps the SOC analyst understand the sequence of events instead of investigating each alert in isolation.

