## 13. Write a SOC Investigation Report

Use this template for your own evidence:

```text
Alert Name:
Repeated SSH Authentication Failures

Host:
[Your lab hostname]

Source IP:
[Observed source IP]

Target Username:
[Observed username]

Time Window:
[Start time – End time]

Evidence:
[Log entries and Wazuh rule details]

Related Activity:
[Successful login, sudo, process, or network events]

Initial Assessment:
[Expected / Suspicious / Inconclusive]

Reason:
[Explain what the evidence supports]

Recommended Next Step:
[Continue investigation, validate with system owner,
or follow the approved incident-response process]
```

Never invent an alert, timestamp, source IP, or screenshot. Record only what you actually observed.

